# ACE known-bug #1 (btrfs_link_unlink): link, sync, unlink the link,
# recreate the name, fsync the new file — the recreated NAME must
# survive, not resurrect the old link.

# define
test
foo
bar

# run
creat foo 0777
write foo 0 4096
link foo bar
sync
checkpoint 1
unlink bar
creat bar 0777
fsync bar
checkpoint 2
